:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Loincloth Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Skirt Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]] and can be purchased for 90 [[Cat Food]] in the [[Upgrade Menu]] after completing [[Greece (Empire of Cats)|Greece]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 2. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]] gains a faster attack rate and grants [[Barrier Breaker]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], they are unlocked from clearing [[Saturn (Cats of the Cosmos)|Saturn]] and costs 18000 XP. in Chapter 3. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], Skirt Cat is unlocked from clearing [[France (Into the Future)|France]] in the [[Into the Future]] chapter and costs 45 Cat Food.

