==Talents==
''Accessible at level '''30'''''

*'''[[Barrier Breaker]]''': Upgrades chance to break barriers by 2% per level up to 20% (Total Cost: 125 NP)
*'''[[Immune to Warp]]''' (Cost: 75 NP)
*'''[[Weaken]]''': Adds a 30% chance to weaken [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemies to 50% for 39f <sup>1.3s</sup>, improves by 9f <sup>0.3s</sup> per level up to 120f <sup>4s</sup> (Total Cost: 215 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Stat Enhancements|HP Buff]]''': Upgrades health by 8% per level up to 80% (Total Cost: 125 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Stat Enhancements|Attack Buff]]''': Upgrades attack power by 8% per level up to 80% (Total Cost: 125 NP)

