==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Skirt Cat was a part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[Showing Leg (Removed Combo)|Showing Leg]].
*Loincloth Cat was among the units that were given [[Barrier Breaker]] in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]].
*Prior to [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]], Skirt Cat's descriptions read as follows:
<pre>Skirt Cat
Found a nicely fitting skirt at a boutique.
Likes to wear it out… all the time.
Advanced variation of Sexy Legs Cat.</pre>
<pre>Tights Cat
Looking for some variety, stumbled across
a garter belt at the dollar store.
Advanced variation of Sexy Legs Cat</pre>
<pre>Loincloth Cat
Chose traditional undies to better show off
shapely legs, and started a viral fashion trend.
Rapid attacks with chance to break Barriers!</pre>
*In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], its True Form goes unused and can only be obtainable via safe file editing, when edited to its True Form, Loincloth Cat still retains the Barrier Breaker ability.

